      "message": "A small question here. enc-\u003erng is a uint16_t, the same type as aom_cdf_prob. I wonder if the compiler then has to reload the state after each update_cdf() call, because it can\u0027t rule out that the cdf write changed enc-\u003erng. In my CL I copy low, rng and cnt into a local struct for the whole block to avoid this.",
